        "Content": "Take a Virtual Tour here: https://view.ricoh360.com/a4acc1ea-3a5d-4624-bfed-29bafceff38d\r\n\r\n11 Temple Manor Drive, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nA Beautifully Presented Family Home in a Prime Residential Setting\r\n\r\nKW Team Castle is delighted to present No. 11 Temple Manor Drive, a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached residence ideally positioned within the highly regarded Temple Manor development. Nestled on a quiet, tree-lined road, this charming home combines bright, spacious living accommodation with excellent future potential, making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers, and those seeking a well-connected Dublin location.\r\n\r\nBright & Spacious Living\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway leading to a thoughtfully designed layout that maximises both natural light and functionality.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining, and living areas flow seamlessly together, creating a warm and inviting space perfectly suited to modern family life. Whether entertaining guests, enjoying family meals, or relaxing after a busy day, these interconnected living spaces offer comfort and versatility in equal measure.\r\n\r\nFlexible Accommodation\r\n\r\nThe property boasts three generously proportioned bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms, providing ample space for growing families or those working from home.\r\n\r\nAdding further appeal is the spacious attic, which offers excellent conversion potential (subject to planning permission), creating the opportunity for a home office, playroom, guest suite, or additional bedroom.\r\n\r\nPrivate Outdoor Space\r\n\r\nTo the rear, a private garden bordered by mature greenery provides a peaceful retreat from city life. Ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining, children's play, or gardening enthusiasts, this generous outdoor space offers endless possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a private side entrance and a substantial front driveway providing ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nExceptional Location\r\n\r\nTemple Manor is one of Dublin 12's most sought-after residential developments, offering an ideal balance of convenience, connectivity, and lifestyle amenities.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy close proximity to the beautiful parklands of Tymon Park, perfect for walking, running, cycling, and family recreation.\r\n\r\nExcellent shopping facilities are available nearby, including SuperValu Walkinstown and Ashleaf Shopping Centre, while a range of schools, sporting clubs, and local services are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nCommuters will appreciate the property's superb connectivity, with quick access to the M50 (Junction 11), Walkinstown Roundabout, and regular public transport services, including the F3 and 15A bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nApprox. 85 sq.m. / 915 sq.ft. of well-proportioned accommodation\r\nThree spacious bedrooms\r\nTwo bathrooms\r\nBright open-plan living, dining, and kitchen areas\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nPrivate side entrance\r\nGenerous off-street parking\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nBER D1\r\nQuiet family-friendly location\r\nAttic suitable for conversion (subject to planning permission)\r\nExcellent transport links and M50 access\r\nWalking distance to local amenities and parks\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Contact KW Team Castle today to arrange your appointment and discover everything this exceptional family home has to offer."
